# ============================================================
# DandersFrames Unit Frames -- resident companion
# ============================================================
# No SavedVariables: every setting lives in the active DandersFrames profile
# (DF.db.unitframes, registered as a profile-root table), so profiles, import
# and export carry it with everything else.
# No DandersUI embed: this addon draws no settings widgets. Its pages live in
# DandersFrames_Options.
# Load order: Core (namespace, db accessors) -> Defaults (registers the profile
# table) -> Units (spawning, events) -> Preview (sample frames) -> BlizzardHide
# -> Mover.

Core.lua
Defaults.lua
Units.lua
Preview.lua
BlizzardHide.lua
Mover.lua
